        "id": "prefix",
        "text": "Stripe's API-keys page documents sk_test_ as the prefix of a test secret key. The secret and restricted key types are told apart by their first segment (sk_ or rk_) and the environment segment (live_ or test_).",
        "evidenceClass": "provider-documented",
        "temporality": "current",
        "observedAt": "2026-09-20",
